<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">victĭto</span></b> , āre,
			v. freq. a.
		vivo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to live</i>, <i>feed</i>, <i>support one's self</i>, <i>subsist</i> on any
			thing (ante-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ficis victitamus aridis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 3, 4, 59</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinapi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Truc. 2, 2, 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suco suo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Capt. 1, 1, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Truc. 2, 3, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bene libenter,</span>”
				<i>to live freely</i>, <i>live high</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 5, 8, 44</span></i>
			.</div>
